# --- ROS 2 / colcon build artefacts ---------------------------------------------------------
# The workspace keeps build/, install/ and log/ inside the tree (≈1.1 GB), so they must never be
# committed. `log/` also contains local diagnostic probes and is deliberately ignored wholesale.
build/
install/
log/
build_standalone/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.so.*

# --- CMake -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Makefile
compile_commands.json
Testing/

# --- editors / tooling -----------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.cache/
.clangd/

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# --- case study runtime artefacts ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The Gazebo harness writes generated URDF/YAML, gzserver logs and a throwaway HOME tree here.
# That tree previously captured a real PulseAudio cookie; runtime output must never be committed.
# Kept locally for inspection, reproducible with case_study/scripts/phase_b.sh.
case_study/logs/

# --- ROS local state ------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ros/
.gazebo/
*.bag

# --- third-party material kept only for local reference --------------------------------------
# FineMote is the学长's embedded framework (source + paper). It is reference material for this
# research, not part of the deliverable, and it is many MB of vendored code and prebuilt archives.
# Excluded so the repository stays reviewable.
FineMote-main/
FineMote-main.zip
FineMote系统内版本.pdf
FineMote论文_文本.txt
# The published paper (and its extracted text) are the same reference material; the extracted text
# lives under log/ (already ignored) and only the paths used in doc/PAPER_ALIGNMENT_2026-09-28.md
# are referenced.
2608.04600v1.pdf
2608.04600v1.txt

.coverage
build_tsan/
install_tsan/
log_tsan/
